    "body": "The brief water-icon flashes had two source causes: an unrelated locked state cleared every marker, and one missed 2 Hz object-pool scan deleted a valid marker without checking the stored water object. The repair keeps lock state diagnostic-only and validates the stored object plus blip before removal. It also reads the exact leading state once and shares it across marker and drinking gates. This is source-complete but not built or installed. After installation, lead the owned horse continuously past water for more than ten seconds; the icon must remain stable and disappear immediately when leading stops.",
